WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:05.689
Share your work as a link, an image, or a narrated story.

00:00:06.504 --> 00:00:11.823
Share and Print creates a link that reproduces your exact map view.

00:00:12.484 --> 00:00:18.153
Download the map as a P N G image, or open a printable view.

00:00:18.820 --> 00:00:23.559
Advanced options can include your story in the shared link.

00:00:24.211 --> 00:00:26.855
Click again to close it.

00:00:27.516 --> 00:00:35.194
Story captures scenes, with their camera, layers and time, into a narrative you can share.

00:00:35.867 --> 00:00:41.856
Capture Scene saves the current view as a step, with a title and description.

00:00:42.524 --> 00:00:46.033
Close the story editor when you are done.

00:00:46.694 --> 00:00:52.933
That is sharing and stories. One link reproduces your exact view.
